<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see scattered showers.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see scattered showers.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Wednesday were forecast to see a mix of sun and cloud with showers, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see scattered showers with highs of 17 to 24 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see a mix of sun and cloud with a chance of rain and highs of 23 to 30 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see morning showers with highs of 24 to 32 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
